WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:19.540
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:41.540
Episode 8
The Scene That He Sees

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:45.370
All the invitations were sent out last week.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:47.370
Each family representative

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:49.880
will participate in the ceremony, 
except for the Shito family.

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:52.000
And the food?

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:53.620
There are no issues.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:57.660
We can begin the feast as soon 
as the ceremony is finished.

00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:01.680
Good. This ceremony is 
important, you understand?

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.180
Even grandmother said we absolutely 
cannot have any mistakes.

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:06.350
Yes.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.600
It's time.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.630
How is the Youmeishi's progress?

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.150
He has finished bathing and changing.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:18.820
However...

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.200
What is it?

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.030
He does not seem to be feeling very well.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:31.690
Master, please raise your head up a bit.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:45.140
Master, the ceremony is starting. 
Please, let me finish your makeup.

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.980
I wonder what's wrong with him.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:52.400
I don't know. He's been like 
this since this morning.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.370
<i>Tanmoku Ki didn't sleep at all last night.</i>

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.570
<i>He just laid there in silence</i>

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:12.370
<i>and no matter what I said,
I couldn't get a reaction out of him.</i>

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.630
<i>He only ever said one thing.</i>

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:20.260
He's still alive.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.740
<i>Is he still thinking about Shouken?</i>

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:25.510
Jiun-sama.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:29.850
I'll do it. Leave.

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:31.310
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.070
You too.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:37.190
But...

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:38.940
Leave it to me.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:50.370
Shinryuu Shouken is alive. 
Why do you look so down?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.130
It's the day of the ceremony 
and yet you're such a mess.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:03.380
This the the first time in history we've 
had such an irresponsible Youmeishi.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.640
You couldn't be more disgusting.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:08.390
Disgusting...

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.520
If I'm so disgusting, then you go do it!

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:18.230
Enough of this!

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.030
I would've done it already if I could.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:31.370
<i>They used to do human sacrifices 
during the ceremony,</i>

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:35.500
<i>but now the Youmeishi offers up their own 
spiritual energy to the gods and purifies</i>

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.500
<i>the spiritual energy of heaven and earth.</i>

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:42.550
<i>Once the ceremony starts, it cannot 
be stopped before it's over.</i>

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:45.380
<i>If anything happens to Tanmoku Ki...</i>

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:49.010
It's okay. He understands.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.390
He knows that this ceremony is important.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.730
Will he really be okay?

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.430
Of course he will!

00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:00.280
He spent a night with me, Ouyou You,

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:04.280
the best feng shui master in the world. 
There's no way he'll mess this up!

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:07.850
Ow!

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:10.460
Ouyou You, why are you here?

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:15.120
I came to see the ceremony as the 
Ouyou family's representative.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.820
Do you know who came from 
the Shinryuu family?

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.050
Isn't it Iku-san like it always is?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.840
It's not.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:25.140
The one who came from the 
Shinryuu family this time is...

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.140
Sekijin-sama!

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.860
He's so wonderful!

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:33.770
So handsome!

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.190
Are you all right?

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.070
I'm fine.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.740
Acting like he's so smooth.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.910
The head of the Shinryuu family came himself?

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:55.540
He's the head of the Shinryuu family?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:05:59.660
Iku Sashi.

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:40.620
Ki-chan's spiritual powers 
really are the best.

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.380
We won't have to train for a 
while once we bathe in this.

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:49.630
In Tetsu-sama, what is it?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.640
The wave of his spiritual power is off.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:58.450
This isn't like you, Tanmoku Ki.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:07.020
Oh my, the Youmeishi seems to be 
quite unlike his usual self today.

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:09.390
What are you saying?

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:13.030
This is all because of your meddling.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.370
Hey, doesn't he seem a bit off?

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:24.080
The mountain god absorbs his spiritual 
energy during the ceremony.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:30.340
He's controlled it well so far, but today...

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:35.960
Mistress, should we help him?

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.170
No.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:41.820
A Youmeishi of the Tanmoku family should 
be able to manage a ceremony such as this.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.250
<i>Tanmoku Ki!</i>

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.870
<i>A-Are you okay?</i>

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:00.550
<i>I seem to have overestimated myself.</i>

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.500
<i>I have to go through with this ceremony.</i>

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.750
<i>But I can't let everyone know 
about the current situation.</i>

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.260
<i>Keika, I have a favor to ask of you.</i>

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.210
<i>There's a break in thirty minutes.</i>

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:17.510
<i>When that happens, take over my body.</i>

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.870
<i>T-Take over your body?</i>

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.020
<i>Possess me and control my body.</i>

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:26.690
<i>Can I even do something like that?</i>

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:28.860
<i>You are my spirit shadow.</i>

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.770
<i>Who else could do it but you?</i>

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:36.160
<i>Good, you're still your usual self.</i>

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.290
Tanmoku Ki!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.150
You'll interrupt the ceremony 
if you go to him now.

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:51.460
But I'm his fiancée and the only one with 
the Nenyou constitution who can save him.

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.530
He has a wealth of experience 
with this ceremony.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.470
I'm sure he can hold out.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.440
Mistress, perhaps we 
should send in some help.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.570
I rather respect him.

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:14.670
He knows that he is the 
Youmeishi of the people

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:18.160
before he is the lone human, Tanmoku Ki.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:23.330
That is what makes him 
an admirable Youmeishi.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.830
Or am I mistaken?

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.530
Did he just cough up blood?

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:36.720
What's wrong with him?

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.060
Tanmoku-san!

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.400
Huh?!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.870
Tanmoku Ki, are you all right?

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.910
Keika, wh-why are you here?

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:08.170
Never mind that, tell me the 
way to take over your body.

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:12.220
It would be impossible for 
you to control me now.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.670
Get back quickly.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:19.530
Look, if you don't tell me, I'm going to 
send spiritual energy to you by force.

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.580
Keika, what are you doing?

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:22.590
Don't move.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:26.770
You're not the only one who can do this.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:36.780
Shiyou, hang in there. 
You still have me!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:40.290
<i>Tanmoku Ki, you belong to me.</i>

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:41.970
<i>I won't hand you over to anyone.</i>

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:46.790
<i>Not even to Shinryuu Shouken or the gods.</i>

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.090
This is...

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:45.710
<i>Now I know how Tanmoku Ki sees the world.</i>

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:49.940
<i>I can feel the spiritual power 
being pulled away from my body.</i>

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:54.310
<i>My and Tanmoku Ki's spiritual power.</i>

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:58.350
<i>Has it always been this impressive?</i>

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:05.940
<i>And it's as if a whole new 
world has opened up before me.</i>

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:13.420
<i>It's the power of life that springs up
 again and again on this planet.</i>

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:21.210
A toast to celebrate the 
success of the ceremony!

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:27.900
Jeez, it's all your fault that 
Tanmoku-san got stolen by him.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:35.660
When you drink, humans 
and spirits are the same.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:40.230
When you get past the tears, 
they're quite the couple.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.740
Yes, there are no particular problems.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.550
Where's grandmother?

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:51.870
She is resting in her room.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.040
I'll go check on her.

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:04.130
We really got to see something good today

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.630
with your spirit shadow 
possessing you like that.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:11.600
Grandmother and the elders 
haven't come in yet.

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:18.100
Maybe I should go apologize...

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.100
Apologize? For what?

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.610
Because they seemed pretty pissed.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.490
Getting up on the altar and 
doing such a shameful thing

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.490
in front of so many people is utterly absurd!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:34.000
You have completely ruined the 
honor of the Tanmoku family!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.460
But I couldn't just stand 
there and watch him die.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:42.130
It is an honor for a Youmeishi 
to die upon the altar.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:45.110
<i>Are these people insane?</i>

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:48.790
The ceremony was a success.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.350
What are you unhappy about?

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:53.690
The rules must be upheld.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.480
Your spirit shadow broke the those rules.
He must be punished.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:14:02.130
I've said this before: no one 
inflicts punishment on him but me.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.530
Will you break that rule?

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:09.700
What? How dare you speak to us 
like that? We are your elders!

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:12.410
Mistress, this is...

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.290
Ki is the head of the family. 
I will not intervene.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:24.000
Remember this: if you try to go 
after him again, I won't show mercy.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:27.040
What? Are you going to 
betray the Tanmoku family?!

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:30.560
Don't think you can manipulate 
me like you used to.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:37.140
You may need me, but I don't need you.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.850
I am strong now.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:46.320
I won't let what happened to 
Shouken happen to you, ever.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.920
Yeah.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.610
You really saved me today.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:02.580
Master, are you doing well?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.610
I did not know you were

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:07.590
the head of the Shinryuu family when 
we met at Shouken's grave. Forgive me.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.960
There's no need.

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:12.670
I got a little too emotional myself.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:17.310
I apologize if I said anything 
inadvertently that upset you.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.100
He was my savior.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:24.560
I regret what happened to him.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:27.480
Oh? Is that really all, master?

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:35.830
Lalalala...

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:43.680
A toast to congratulate you on your success.

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:48.760
I appreciate the thought, 
but I do not drink alcohol.

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:51.310
Ah, I had forgotten.

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:54.760
I heard about your constitution 
from my brother.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:57.050
You can never be too careful.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:01.100
Shouken always took care of me.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:05.110
Do you want to see Shouken again?

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.690
What do you mean by that?

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:13.240
I know about everything the 
Tanmoku family has done to him.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.740
Are you just going to abandon him again?

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:23.500
I have to attend to the 
other guests. Excuse me.

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.450
My brother devoted himself to you,

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:29.310
yet you're running away 
just from hearing his name?

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:34.800
Perhaps you already have an idea in mind?

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.610
Hey, watch what you're saying.

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:42.020
I wasn't going to say anything 
because this was between you humans.

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:44.010
Stop it.

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:46.860
I've been holding myself back 
this whole time because you're

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.670
the head of the Shinryuu family,

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:52.180
but if you keep saying needless 
crap, then I won't go easy on you.

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.690
Keika, just stop.

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.340
I have things to do. Excuse me.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.150
Tanmoku Ki?

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:05.120
My lord, is he going to where Shouken is?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.820
I'm sure he will. Follow him.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.710
Once you find out where he is, 
bring him back to me immediately.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:12.630
Yes, sir.

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:17.450
Tanmoku Ki, where are you going?

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.980
I'm going to correct the 
Tanmoku family's mistake.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:21.250
I'm coming too.

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:21.850
Don't.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.490
It has nothing to do with you.

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:39.680
What, you again?

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:43.620
The last time we met, I thought 
about tearing you limb from limb,

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:47.500
but today I just want 
to chop you into pieces.

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:53.380
But why don't I just rearrange your face now?

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:56.390
We have met more than two times.

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.050
When was that?

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:04.520
But you shouldn't have any memory of it.

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:07.890
You are...

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:12.900
Lend me your powers once again.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:18.710
Break that circle.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:25.250
Shouken, forgive me.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:26.660
I can't run away anymore.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:31.190
It's time to put an end 
to everything in the past.

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.390
What are you doing?!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:45.380
Shouken's body shouldn't 
be in this world anymore.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.110
I'm going to end it myself.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.340
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:55.940
But it's written all over your face.
If you do this, you'll definitely regret it.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:04.030
You've done the best you could.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.150
Don't bear it all alone.

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:10.460
Share the burden with me.
 That's what I'm here for.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:15.550
Don't look at me for a little bit.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.810
Got it.

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:23.340
Are you okay?

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:26.980
I'm fine.

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:30.960
I have an idea.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:31.770
Idea?

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:35.740
What if you try using the 
mirror of the underworld?

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:41.280
The truth of the incident might be different.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.140
You know, like that time with Lingzhi Sekisui.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:47.540
Did you look into my memories?

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:54.080
W-Well, it just happened when I was saving 
you from the nightmare yesterday.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.410
A-All of them?

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.710
Did you even see my childhood memories?

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.930
You were pretty different 
when you were a kid.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.630
When I first saw you,
 I thought you were a girl.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:11.060
Your hair was so long and you were charming.

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:13.340
I wasn't sure what to think.

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:19.110
I'll protect you from now on.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.560
I see. So you saw that.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:24.450
You're not mad at me for 
keeping it from you?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.810
I'm not mad.

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:29.580
You had your reasons
 for not telling me, right?

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:37.350
But if I stay with you and get stronger, 
then you'll be able to tell me anything.

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:48.370
<i>Shouken's body will unlock the
 mirror of the underworld.</i>

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:54.370
We touch him at the same time.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:56.980
On the count of three.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:00.610
One, two, three!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.490
What's going on?

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.510
What is this feeling of dread?

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.270
<i>The soul-binding circle has been broken.</i>

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.540
<i>I have been waiting for this.</i>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:46.910
Shouken.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.590
It's time to go home with me.

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:40.040
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:31.090
Shouken, will this make you happy?

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:36.470
I'm warning you: don't make 
the same mistake again.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.040
<b>His True Identity</b>

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:40.040
I believe my purpose is
to protect someone.
